  #[#set math.equation(numbering: n => "(1.170)")
   $ parallel D Z parallel_(L^(2 p) \( V_x \))^2 lt.eq C H_0 h^theta parallel D^2 Z parallel_(L^p \( V_x^(+) \)) + C H_0^2 h^(2 theta - 2) . $ <n3:existence:global-local-GN>]
