   $ \| f \( x \) - f_0 \| lt.eq psi #scale(x: 120%, y: 120%)[\(] "dist" \( x \, upright("face") \) #scale(x: 120%, y: 120%)[\)] quad upright("in its ") h_0 upright(" collar") . $ <four:ex:boundary-modulus>]
