 $ X = u nu \, #h(2em) partial_nu u + K \( X \, nu \) = kappa . $ <rig4:adj:horizon-data>]

 Either $u > 0$ everywhere on $S$ or $u = 0$ everywhere on $S$.]
  + #emph[On $bb(R) times "int" Omega$, set 
